I suggest Excalibur or Stormy depending on how early you are in
the game when you get your wish.  Excalibur above the Castle,
Stormy below it.

You want level drain protection so that drops Vorpy leaving it the
choice between Stormy or Excalibur. The level drain feature of Stormy
makes it very powerful against any monster nor immune to it.  Rodney
is not immune to it.  The searching feature of Excalibur has more value
the longer it is used.  That's why I suggest it if wished for early.
Also pets matter more early on and Excalibur is better when working
around pets.


